{"gene1":{"symbol":"PAX5","uniprot":"Q02548","is_essential":false,"chromosome":{"chromosome":"9","start":"36833269","end":"37034268","strand":"-1"},"description":{"name":"Paired box protein Pax-5","function":"Transcription factor that plays an essential role in commitment of lymphoid progenitors to the B-lymphocyte lineage (PubMed:10811620, PubMed:27181361). Fulfills a dual role by repressing B-lineage inappropriate genes and simultaneously activating B-lineage-specific genes (PubMed:10811620, PubMed:27181361). In turn, regulates cell adhesion and migration, induces V(H)-to-D(H)J(H) recombination, facilitates pre-B-cell receptor signaling and promotes development to the mature B-cell stage (PubMed:32612238). Repression of the cohesin-release factor WAPL causes global changes of the chromosomal architecture in pro-B cells to facilitate the generation of a diverse antibody repertoire (PubMed:32612238)"},"known_drugs":[]},"gene2":{"symbol":"PAX8","uniprot":"Q06710","is_essential":false,"chromosome":{"chromosome":"2","start":"113215997","end":"113278921","strand":"-1"},"description":{"name":"Paired box protein Pax-8","function":"Transcription factor for the thyroid-specific expression of the genes exclusively expressed in the thyroid cell type, maintaining the functional differentiation of such cells"},"known_drugs":[]},"pair":{"wgd":true,"family_size":51,"closest":false,"same_chr":false,"interact_bioplex":true,"n_shared_ppi":7,"ppi_network":{"shared":[{"id":"10055","symbol":"SAE1","display":"SAE1 (10055)"},{"id":"1018","symbol":"CDK3","display":"CDK3 (1018)"},{"id":"2033","symbol":"EP300","display":"EP300 (2033)"},{"id":"3224","symbol":"HOXC8","display":"HOXC8 (3224)"},{"id":"5925","symbol":"RB1","display":"RB1 (5925)"},{"id":"7091","symbol":"TLE4","display":"TLE4 (7091)"},{"id":"91694","symbol":"LONRF1","display":"LONRF1 (91694)"}],"unique_gene1":[{"id":"1027","symbol":"CDKN1B","display":"CDKN1B (1027)"},{"id":"10286","symbol":null,"display":"10286"},{"id":"11011","sy